Available Commands
/start — Initialize the bot and view instructions

/add <username> — Subscribe to an Instagram creator

/remove <username> — Unsubscribe from a creator

/list — Display all tracked accounts for the current chat

Send Instagram URL — Paste any public post or reel link directly into the chat to fetch the video/photovenv/ 
instagram_bot.db 
